{"3650690": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Stellar Destiny: The Last Survivor", "steam_appid": 3650690, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4194650], "detailed_description": "<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650690/extras/891e528981cbc440857e026cfa7e008c.avif?t=1769289753\" width=1080 height=1600 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650690/extras/3acca3addfb821b17d89b71d56aca237.webp?t=1769289753\" width=1200 height=20 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Have you ever wondered what it would be like if an AI ship could wander through the galaxy and gather any elements it finds? Maybe it would pursue knowledge gathering, maybe a purge of everything for a new &quot;start&quot;. Nobody would know and now you can be part of such a story!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Stellar Destiny: The Last Survivor</strong>, a fast-paced, action-packed sci-fi adventure where survival hinges on your ability to slay monstrous foes, craft powerful gear, and explore uncharted planets. Step into the role of a sentient AI ship, the last of its kind, as it traverses the cosmos, gathering chemical elements and...?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650690/extras/3acca3addfb821b17d89b71d56aca237.webp?t=1769289753\" width=1200 height=20 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650690/extras/3c39aa0c3358a6aad3ca6721647dba03.avif?t=1769289753\" width=1200 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650690/extras/83e7243570f39cf0d43515bb4a1de459.poster.avif?t=1769289753\" width=1170 height=490 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650690/extras/83e7243570f39cf0d43515bb4a1de459.webm?t=1769289753\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650690/extras/3acca3addfb821b17d89b71d56aca237.webp?t=1769289753\" width=1200 height=20 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Explore planets and mine rare elements on each planet. However, be aware that each planet has its unique flora and fauna, which will not be friendly and will defend itself against invasive AI. Each planet has its specific theme and will challenge you differently. The more difficult the environment, the greater reward you will get!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650690/extras/7b0a048fc05b367a51286eb285a11bae.avif?t=1769289753\" width=1200 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650690/extras/708f2dced1ec699ebd9d73d3f76d5242.poster.avif?t=1769289753\" width=720 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650690/extras/708f2dced1ec699ebd9d73d3f76d5242.webm?t=1769289753\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650690/extras/3acca3addfb821b17d89b71d56aca237.webp?t=1769289753\" width=1200 height=20 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Slay enemies with unique weapons and combinations of skills. You will be using your trusty sword and drone, which have unique skills to help you in combat. As you continue to explore and slay enemies, you will be able to obtain abilities not only for you, but also for your trusty drone, which can be turned into a deadly weapon.<br><br>Laser, huge strikes, and ability overloads, which make them even stronger! But remember, every decision will have an impact, and you need to decide what deadly tools you will pursue in each run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650690/extras/c45b3566c4ebac8686138c294f7b1727.avif?t=1769289753\" width=1200 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650690/extras/8d48fb59d3eef5f624fcca9c502d2fc5.poster.avif?t=1769289753\" width=1170 height=490 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650690/extras/8d48fb59d3eef5f624fcca9c502d2fc5.webm?t=1769289753\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650690/extras/3acca3addfb821b17d89b71d56aca237.webp?t=1769289753\" width=1200 height=20 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\